docs: ORIN-GLASSINK — INK-FLAT-FILL, blevels, and the measurements that produced them

The §3.11 verdict table and the rung (a) watch card gain the fourth stem=0 shape, and
the witness bullet is re-measured against the final artifact: six new fragments (once
each armed, zero in both negative controls), all ten verdict strings materialised by
live adr/adrp+add inside orin_glass_probe, and the census's own reference to the
passing set. Adds the bullet the previous arc could not write: the classifier was
extracted verbatim and RUN on the host, and that run is what found the PANEL_BG hole.

